// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`immutable binary inspection > explains how to replace a source snapshot with an imported file before collection > binary input guide 1`] = `"Select an imported single file with assetId, not a source directory or parameters.path. The coordinator can read security_help(action: "import") and use security_command with action.kind "import" and the authorized absolute file path; delegated analysts must ask the coordinator to import it. identity requires parameters "{}". hex and strings accept byte offset and length; length defaults to maxOutputBytes/8 and cannot exceed it. strings also accepts minLength (default 4), encoding ascii or utf16le (default ascii); only printable ASCII characters are extracted. Overlap pages to check strings crossing a page edge. Input is the immutable imported artifact; no executable is needed."`;
